0.2 0.2 0.2 setrgbcolor
135 145 moveto (Historical data: Horowitz et al. and Rupp; modern additions use cited manufacturer and SPEC sources.) show
135 115 moveto (Filled markers: GPU or GPU component; outlined: CPU/other. FP32 shapes: discrete GPU triangle, integrated GPU square, APU GPU diamond.) show
135 85 moveto (Shipping through 2026-09-22. Apple M-series single-core: Geekbench 7/M1-anchored index, not a SPEC score. GPU-only FP32 is peak capacity.) show
135 55 moveto (Black diamonds: unconnected estimates of one-chip CPU throughput, 2003 = 100; suite bridges are not official SPEC conversions.) show
135 25 moveto (Each series uses the unit and multiplier printed beside it. The shared log axis has no common unit: compare trends, not cross-series heights.) show
